From 8280e07ef84f308d8e0273f4310789895537f7af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scroll Ash Lab <scrollash.lab@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:42:33 -1000
Subject: [PATCH] tifxyz: add vesuvius.tifxyz_audit CLI for mesh metadata QA

Wraps meta_frames (#1522) with a CI-friendly auditor: meta/scale checks,
optional TIFF sampling, JSON/text reports, and annotate-voxel-size helper.
Tolerant scale matching lives in #1522 (SCALE_RTOL); this commit no longer
patches meta_frames.
